# The scene before the stage, in the engine's `.dlg` format
# (`shuyi_assets::dialogue`): `@left` stands the guide on the left (its
# expression unused: the game has no portraits), `>` is narration,
# `guide:` a line the guide says.
@scene intro
@left guide calm
> A small grid: twelve tiles by ten, walls, and a goal in the top right.
guide: Walk your piece to the goal. It goes up to four tiles a turn.
guide: After each of your moves the foe steps one tile toward you. If it steps onto you, you lose.
guide: It trips now and then. Good luck!
@end
